      "id": "claim_c946b125db0f4af0b34cfffeef5d5f23",
      "statement": "ZeroHub.GetOrCreateHub performs the read-then-write under a sync.Mutex so concurrent join-or-create calls for the same hub ID collapse to a single hub instead of orphaning one.",
