      "statement": "/v1/status is a public read-only health and migration endpoint that answers with a static Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * plus Vary: Origin, a constant rather than a reflection of the request Origin header, because reflecting an arbitrary origin is the classic CORS anti-pattern and is unnecessary when the endpoint is open to all origins; the exposed status and backupHost data is considered public.",
